<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 24.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 24.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 24     July 23   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  285.750     285.420     247.020   15.68 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.380     309.410     306.830    0.83 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.205     156.080     158.970   -1.74 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.358	46.310	47.182   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  478.640     479.980     419.180   14.18 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.700     138.620     141.685   -2.11 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.067	16.064	16.185   -0.73 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  247.200     247.530     212.430   16.37 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.855	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.549	 1.547	 1.581   -2.02 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  192.300     192.470     183.135    5.00 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
